{"4452250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cloudborn", "steam_appid": 4452250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the freedom of soaring through cloud seas, wild plains, and towering peaks. A fast-paced 20-minute joyride. No thinking—just follow your fingers' instinct for flashy combat and satisfying skill bursts, releasing daily stress. Stack enough passives for a qualitative power surge and explosive thrill. To you who long for freedom—this is my final fantasy!</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the freedom of soaring through cloud seas, wild plains, and towering peaks. A fast-paced 20-minute joyride. No thinking—just follow your fingers' instinct for flashy combat and satisfying skill bursts, releasing daily stress. Stack enough passives for a qualitative power surge and explosive thrill. To you who long for freedom—this is my final fantasy!</h2>", "short_description": "A tiny high-speed aerial Roguelike. Fight freely like an action game hero: fly, dodge, dash, chase. Random buffs, combine skills, forge your unique sky-combat style. I know this game has no audience—it's just to realize my dream of soaring and battling among clouds. For you who long for freedom.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452250/a8176b43384cbfa2d4ccd668cb895d51e9ce8764/header.jpg?t=1788313696", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452250/a3898997634c5e067e1543df2b5f12c5ce0191ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788313696", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452250/a3898997634c5e067e1543df2b5f12c5ce0191ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788313696", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li>